      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "\"Payhip wins on pricing accessibility. A $0 entry point with all features included is genuinely rare in ecommerce. Shopify offers more infrastructure at higher tiers, but for lean creator businesses, Payhip's model is the more affordable starting point.\"",
      "context_before": null,
      "context_after": null,
